  "text": "Bearish EMA trends = Here's the cheat sheet ⬇️\n\nBelow 200 EMA = Bearish\nBelow 200 + 48 EMA = More Bearish\nBelow 200 + 48 + 13 EMA = Mega Bearish\n\nThe strongest downside momentum happens when...\n\n200 EMA on top 🔴\n48 EMA in middle 🟣\n13 EMA on bottom 🟡\n\nStudy this bearish price https://t.co/FOVQgyfwML",
